{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:0": "唔呵！好～啟動成功！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:1": "看得見我嗎？我就是創造你的\n天才科學家──蛋頭博士大人！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:2": "你是我打造的\nＥ－１００系列製造編號第二號……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:3": "Ｅ－１０２！\n代號「Gamma」！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:4": "Gamma……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:5": "嗯！以後可要\n好好聽我的話啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/02 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:0": "這扇門後面\n就是為你準備的訓練場！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/02 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:1": "不過前輩機器人Ｅ－１０１「Beta」\n早就前往訓練場了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/02 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:2": "去吧，Gamma！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/02 Before Final Egg/Japanese.txt:3": "我對你的期待沒有Beta那麼高，\n隨便努力一下就行了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/03 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:0": "辛苦了，Gamma！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/03 After Final Egg/Japanese.txt:1": "沒想到你還挺有一套的嘛？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/04 Final Egg Failed (Unused)/Japanese.txt:0": "搞什麼，Gamma！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/04 Final Egg Failed (Unused)/Japanese.txt:1": "竟然連這種訓練場\n都過不了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/04 Final Egg Failed (Unused)/Japanese.txt:2": "沒辦法，再來一次！\n喏，快去！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "好～那麼現在開始測試！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "這是依照我崇高的設計理念\n打造的超萬能巨大空中戰鬥要塞……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "「蛋頭母艦」的\n登艦選拔測試！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "出來吧，Beta！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "這是Ｅ系列的同型機，\n前輩機器人Ｅ－１０１「Beta」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "你們兩個對戰，獲勝的一方\n將錄用為蛋頭母艦的搭乘成員。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/05 Before Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "嘛，反正一定是Beta會贏，\n你就姑且試試看吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "哇哈哈！\n了不起啊，Gamma！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "我從一開始\n就覺得你一定辦得到！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "根據這次的結果，\n准許Gamma搭乘蛋頭母艦。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "啊～嗯？你也\n想搭蛋頭母艦嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "好啦好啦，我知道了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "哼……\n嘛，多少還有點用處吧。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/06 After Beta Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "特別准許你登艦。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:0": "啊～啊～。\n麥克風測試，今天天氣晴？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:1": "咳咳！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:2": "獲准登上蛋頭母艦的精英們！\n相信各位都越來越鬥志高昂了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:3": "那麼，今天召集各位\n不為別的！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:4": "就是這隻長著尾巴的青蛙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:5": "這正是這次作戰不可或缺的\n重要青蛙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:6": "因此，各位的使命就是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:7": "就算翻遍每一寸土地，\n也要把這隻青蛙找出來抓回來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:8": "此事刻不容緩！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/07 Eggman's Very Special Announcement/Japanese.txt:9": "立刻出擊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/08 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:0": "此處是……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/08 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:1": "資料比對……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/08 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:2": "無資料……目前位置不明……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/08 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:3": "……傷腦筋。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:0": "不行！\n不要再靠近了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:1": "……對不起。\n你……不一樣呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:2": "你……注意到了嗎？\n守護著那些孩子的存在……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:3": "……他是個溫柔的人。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:4": "守護著那些放著不管\n就會消逝的小小生命……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:5": "因為有他在，那些孩子\n才能那樣安心地歌唱……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:6": "雖然我第一次看到他的時候\n也嚇了一跳。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:7": "可是父親他們，連那些孩子\n最後的容身之處都想奪走……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:8": "所以，他也\n封閉了自己的心……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/09 Tikal Flashback/Japanese.txt:9": "真希望有一天\n大家能夠互相理解……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:0": "啊啊啊，不對不對不對不對～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:1": "這根本是完全不同的青蛙嘛！\n你們眼睛長到哪裡去了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:10": "去最裡面那扇門……\n後面的房間。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:11": "牢裡有個女孩藏著一隻小鳥。\n去把牠搶過來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:12": "好，去吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:2": "我要的是被卡歐斯的尾巴\n附身的重要青蛙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:3": "而且牠嘴裡\n還含著混沌翡翠啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:4": "唔唔！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:5": "就是這個！這才是真貨！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:6": "不愧是Gamma！\n幹得好！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:7": "我就知道\n你一定辦得到！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:8": "其他的都沒用了！\n給我滾到一邊去！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/10 Dummies, dummies, dummies, dummies!/Japanese.txt:9": "給你一個新任務吧。\n放心，是很簡單的工作。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/11 Pick a door, any door/Japanese.txt:0": "是此處嗎……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/12 BETA/Japanese.txt:0": "Beta……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/13 ...This is the wrong room/Japanese.txt:1": "似乎走錯房間了……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/15 Get ready for battle instructions!/Japanese.txt:0": "啊～啊～。\n麥克風測試，麥克風測試。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/15 Get ready for battle instructions!/Japanese.txt:1": "Gamma！緊急戰鬥部署！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/15 Get ready for battle instructions!/Japanese.txt:2": "首先，到武器庫\n去拿『推進器』！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/16 Here's the Jet Booster/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「推進器」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/16 Here's the Jet Booster/Japanese.txt:1": "持續按住跳躍鈕，\n就能在空中浮起一小段時間。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/17 I see you've got the Jet Booster/Japanese.txt:0": "很好。\n拿到「推進器」了吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/17 I see you've got the Jet Booster/Japanese.txt:1": "那就火速\n趕到後方第一甲板來！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/17 I see you've got the Jet Booster/Japanese.txt:2": "動作快！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/18 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "遵命，蛋頭博士。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/18 Before Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "接下來就交給你了",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "艾咪！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "可不能放著\n那傢伙不管！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "吶，你還好嗎？\n這裡好像已經很危險了。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:13": "你也別再聽蛋頭博士的話了，\n快點逃吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "……為何\n……為何……要救我……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "我不是說過，\n下次見面就是朋友了嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:16": "這孩子也\n這麼擔心你呢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:17": "你絕對不可以再待在\n蛋頭博士身邊了喔！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:18": "艾咪，走囉！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "機器人先生，\n你……不是那種人吧？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "吶……住手。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/19 After Sonic Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "……看來好像有什麼隱情。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/20 A New Mission/Japanese.txt:0": "解除蛋頭博士的\n主人登錄……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/20 A New Mission/Japanese.txt:1": "Ｅ系列……同伴……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/20 A New Mission/Japanese.txt:2": "救出……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/21 Delta and Epsilon Rescued/Japanese.txt:0": "Ｅ－１０３「Delta」、\nＥ－１０４「Epsilon」救出完畢……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/21 Delta and Epsilon Rescued/Japanese.txt:1": "Ｅ－１０５「Zeta」、\nＥ－１０１「Beta」下落不明……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/21 Delta and Epsilon Rescued/Japanese.txt:2": "莫非……\n仍在蛋頭母艦上……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/22 Unlocking Hot Shelter sector, now/Japanese.txt:0": "開始搜尋Ｅ系列資料……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/22 Unlocking Hot Shelter sector, now/Japanese.txt:2": "找到符合項目。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/22 Unlocking Hot Shelter sector, now/Japanese.txt:3": "確認『灼熱避難所』內\n有Ｅ系列存在。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/22 Unlocking Hot Shelter sector, now/Japanese.txt:4": "解除『灼熱避難所』的\n鎖定。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/23 E-105 Zeta rescue complete/Japanese.txt:0": "Ｅ－１０５「Zeta」……救出完畢。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/23 E-105 Zeta rescue complete/Japanese.txt:1": "剩下的是……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/23 E-105 Zeta rescue complete/Japanese.txt:2": "我……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/23 E-105 Zeta rescue complete/Japanese.txt:3": "Beta……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/24 Here's your Laser Blaster/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「參式雷射槍」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Gamma/24 Here's your Laser Blaster/Japanese.txt:1": "攻擊後爆炸會擴散開來，\n可以打倒大範圍的敵人喔。"
}